Package: ms-a2-fancontrol
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ProxForge <ms-a2-fancontrol@proxforge.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/proxforge/ms-a2-fancontrol
Description: Fan control for Minisforum MS-A2 by NVMe, RAM and CPU temperature
 Raises the fan curves in the embedded controller (ITE IT5571) of the
 Minisforum MS-A2 only as far as NVMe, RAM and CPU temperatures require, never
 below the firmware levels. Needs Secure Boot disabled (access to the EC
 I/O ports).
